From: Thorch Android storage adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Defer legacy HWKM BIST register read until initialized

Legacy HWKM initialization is deferred until the TME provider is loaded.
Its BIST register read must not run on the deferred path. Ordinary ICE BIST
continues to run; this does not disable checks after HWKM initialization.

diff --git a/drivers/soc/qcom/ice.c b/drivers/soc/qcom/ice.c
--- a/drivers/soc/qcom/ice.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/qcom/ice.c
@@ -267,7 +267,12 @@
 		return err;
 	}
 
+	/* Legacy initialization is deferred until the TME provider is loaded.
+	 * Do not touch the HWKM register bank while that initialization is
+	 * pending. The ordinary ICE BIST above still applies to plain I/O.
+	 */
 	if (ice->use_hwkm &&
+	    (!ice->android_legacy_hwkm || ice->hwkm_init_complete) &&
 	    qcom_ice_readl(ice, QCOM_ICE_REG_HWKM_TZ_KM_STATUS) !=
 	    (QCOM_ICE_HWKM_KT_CLEAR_DONE |
 	     QCOM_ICE_HWKM_BOOT_CMD_LIST0_DONE |
